title: Direct development checkout installation exceeds the host source scan cap
description: "The pinned host refuses local package source snapshots after 10000 entries, even for a development checkout whose dependencies are not shipped. Installing a local directory extracted from the packed package is the supported v0 workaround. Improving host inventory filtering or source-scan budgeting belongs upstream and is outside this package-only run."
